# AI-CONTEXT:
#
# Purpose:
# - Defines intentionally untracked files for the backend project version control.
#
# Scope:
# - Prevents IDE files, compiled binaries, secrets, stray documents, and AI
#   workspace folders from entering Git.
# - Must NEVER ignore src/ or config/ — these are critical source directories.
#
# Security Constraints:
# - All .env variants and key files (.pem, .key) must remain ignored.
# - AI session folders (BACKEND CODE FILES/, RULES OF ENGAGEMENT/) must be ignored.
#
# IMMUTABLE CHANGE HISTORY (DO NOT DELETE):
# - EDITED:
#   • Replaced global wildcard ignore with strict, scoped ignores.
#   • Unblocked src/ and config/ to allow critical security files to reach the deployment server.
#   • Phase: CI/CD Pipeline Fix.
# - EDITED:
#   • Added stray files: "New Text Document.txt", docs_file_list.json,
#     verification_test.txt, auth_trigger.txt, HANDOVER_DOCUMENT_TEMPLATE.md.
#   • Added *.txt catch-all for temporary text files.
#   • Date: 2026-05-25 / Docs Restructure Phase.

# ============================================================
# BUILD ARTIFACTS
# ============================================================
target/
!.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/target/
!**/src/test/**/target/

# ============================================================
# IDE FILES
# ============================================================

### Spring Tool Suite ###
.apt_generated
.classpath
.factorypath
.project
.settings
.springBeans
.sts4-cache

### IntelliJ IDEA ###
.idea
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr

### NetBeans ###
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/.nb-gradle/
build/

### VS Code ###
.vscode/

# ============================================================
# OS FILES
# ============================================================
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ============================================================
# ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS — NEVER COMMIT THESE
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.dev.example
*.pem
*.key

# Terraform values (added 2026-08-23, OCI Migration Phase 1) — tfvars carry
# tenancy/user OCIDs, API key fingerprints and Bastion CIDRs; oci_api_key.pem
# is already covered by *.pem above.
terraform.tfvars
*.tfvars
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup

# ============================================================
# AI SESSION & TEMPORARY WORKSPACE FOLDERS
# ============================================================
BACKEND_CODE_FILES/
BACKEND CODE FILES/
RULES OF ENGAGEMENT/
RULES OF ENGAGEMENT & AI INSTRUCTIONS & EDITS/

# ============================================================
# STRAY / TEMPORARY FILES
# ============================================================
TODO.md
HELP.md
HANDOVER_DOCUMENT.md
HANDOVER_DOCUMENT_TEMPLATE.md
docs_file_list.json
New Text Document.txt
verification_test.txt
auth_trigger.txt

